{"page":438,"verses":[{"verse_key":"35:31","surah":35,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِىٓ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْكَ مِنَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ هُوَ ٱلْحَقُّ مُصَدِّقًا لِّمَا بَيْنَ يَدَيْهِ ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِعِبَادِهِۦ لَخَبِيرٌۢ بَصِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Scripture We have revealed to you [Prophet] is the Truth and confirms the scriptures that preceded it. God is well informed about His servants, He sees everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"And (that) which","transliteration":"wa-alladhī","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"We have revealed","transliteration":"awḥaynā","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْحَقُّ","en_gloss":"(is) the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُصَدِّقًۭا","en_gloss":"confirming","transliteration":"muṣaddiqan","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِّمَا","en_gloss":"what (was)","transliteration":"limā","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَدَيْهِ ۗ","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"yadayhi","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِعِبَادِهِۦ","en_gloss":"of His slaves","transliteration":"biʿibādihi","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَخَبِيرٌۢ","en_gloss":"surely, (is) All-Aware","transliteration":"lakhabīrun","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَصِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Seer","transliteration":"baṣīrun","verse_key":"35:31"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:31"}]},{"verse_key":"35:32","surah":35,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ أَوْرَثْنَا ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱصْطَفَيْنَا مِنْ عِبَادِنَا ۖ فَمِنْهُمْ ظَالِمٌ لِّنَفْسِهِۦ وَمِنْهُم مُّقْتَصِدٌ وَمِنْهُمْ سَابِقٌۢ بِٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ بِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ هُوَ ٱلْفَضْلُ ٱلْكَبِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We gave the Scripture as a heritage to Our chosen servants: some of them wronged their own souls, some stayed between [right and wrong], and some, by God’s leave, were foremost in good deeds. That is the greatest favour:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَوْرَثْنَا","en_gloss":"We caused to inherit","transliteration":"awrathnā","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱصْطَفَيْنَا","en_gloss":"We have chosen","transliteration":"iṣ'ṭafaynā","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عِبَادِنَا ۖ","en_gloss":"Our slaves","transliteration":"ʿibādinā","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَمِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"and among them","transliteration":"famin'hum","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ظَالِمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is he) who wrongs","transliteration":"ẓālimun","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِّنَفْسِهِۦ","en_gloss":"himself","transliteration":"linafsihi","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَمِنْهُم","en_gloss":"and among them","transliteration":"wamin'hum","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُّقْتَصِدٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is he who is) moderate","transliteration":"muq'taṣidun","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"and among them","transliteration":"wamin'hum","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"سَابِقٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is he who is) foremost","transliteration":"sābiqun","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ","en_gloss":"in good deeds","transliteration":"bil-khayrāti","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بِإِذْنِ","en_gloss":"by permission","transliteration":"bi-idh'ni","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":19,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلْفَضْلُ","en_gloss":"the Bounty","transliteration":"l-faḍlu","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلْكَبِيرُ","en_gloss":"the great","transliteration":"l-kabīru","verse_key":"35:32"},{"pos":22,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:32"}]},{"verse_key":"35:33","surah":35,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتُ عَدْنٍ يَدْخُلُونَهَا يُحَلَّوْنَ فِيهَا مِنْ أَسَاوِرَ مِن ذَهَبٍ وَلُؤْلُؤًا ۖ وَلِبَاسُهُمْ فِيهَا حَرِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they will enter lasting Gardens where they will be adorned with bracelets of gold and pearls, where they will wear silk garments.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"جَنَّـٰتُ","en_gloss":"Gardens","transliteration":"jannātu","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَدْنٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) Eternity","transliteration":"ʿadnin","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَدْخُلُونَهَا","en_gloss":"they will enter them","transliteration":"yadkhulūnahā","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُحَلَّوْنَ","en_gloss":"They will be adorned","transliteration":"yuḥallawna","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَسَاوِرَ","en_gloss":"bracelets","transliteration":"asāwira","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ذَهَبٍۢ","en_gloss":"gold","transliteration":"dhahabin","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلُؤْلُؤًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"and pearls","transliteration":"walu'lu-an","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلِبَاسُهُمْ","en_gloss":"and their garments","transliteration":"walibāsuhum","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":13,"ar":"حَرِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(will be of) silk","transliteration":"ḥarīrun","verse_key":"35:33"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:33"}]},{"verse_key":"35:34","surah":35,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟ ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَذْهَبَ عَنَّا ٱلْحَزَنَ ۖ إِنَّ رَبَّنَا لَغَفُورٌ شَكُورٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will say, ‘Praise be to God, who has separated us from all sorrow! Our Lord is truly most forgiving, most appreciative:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they (will) say","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"35:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","en_gloss":"All praises","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","verse_key":"35:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"(be) to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"35:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"35:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَذْهَبَ","en_gloss":"(has) removed","transliteration":"adhhaba","verse_key":"35:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَنَّا","en_gloss":"from us","transliteration":"ʿannā","verse_key":"35:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْحَزَنَ ۖ","en_gloss":"the sorrow","transliteration":"l-ḥazana","verse_key":"35:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"35:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَبَّنَا","en_gloss":"our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"35:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَغَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) surely Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"laghafūrun","verse_key":"35:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"شَكُورٌ","en_gloss":"Most Appreciative","transliteration":"shakūrun","verse_key":"35:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:34"}]},{"verse_key":"35:35","surah":35,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ أَحَلَّنَا دَارَ ٱلْمُقَامَةِ مِن فَضْلِهِۦ لَا يَمَسُّنَا فِيهَا نَصَبٌ وَلَا يَمَسُّنَا فِيهَا لُغُوبٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He has, in His bounty, settled us in the everlasting Home where no toil or fatigue will touch us.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"The One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَحَلَّنَا","en_gloss":"has settled us","transliteration":"aḥallanā","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"دَارَ","en_gloss":"(in) a Home","transliteration":"dāra","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمُقَامَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) Eternity","transliteration":"l-muqāmati","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(out) of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَضْلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His Bounty","transliteration":"faḍlihi","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَمَسُّنَا","en_gloss":"touches us","transliteration":"yamassunā","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"نَصَبٌۭ","en_gloss":"any fatigue","transliteration":"naṣabun","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَمَسُّنَا","en_gloss":"touches","transliteration":"yamassunā","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لُغُوبٌۭ","en_gloss":"weariness","transliteration":"lughūbun","verse_key":"35:35"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٣٥","en_gloss":"(35)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:35"}]},{"verse_key":"35:36","surah":35,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ لَهُمْ نَارُ جَهَنَّمَ لَا يُقْضَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ فَيَمُوتُوا۟ وَلَا يُخَفَّفُ عَنْهُم مِّنْ عَذَابِهَا ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ نَجْزِى كُلَّ كَفُورٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But those who reject the truth will stay in Hellfire, where they will neither be finished off by death, nor be relieved from Hell’s torment: this is how We reward hardened disbelievers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَارُ","en_gloss":"(will be the) Fire","transliteration":"nāru","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُقْضَىٰ","en_gloss":"is decreed","transliteration":"yuq'ḍā","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَيَمُوتُوا۟","en_gloss":"that they die","transliteration":"fayamūtū","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُخَفَّفُ","en_gloss":"will be lightened","transliteration":"yukhaffafu","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَنْهُم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَذَابِهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"its torment","transliteration":"ʿadhābihā","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":16,"ar":"نَجْزِى","en_gloss":"We recompense","transliteration":"najzī","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كُلَّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulla","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":18,"ar":"كَفُورٍۢ","en_gloss":"ungrateful one","transliteration":"kafūrin","verse_key":"35:36"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٣٦","en_gloss":"(36)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:36"}]},{"verse_key":"35:37","surah":35,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُمْ يَصْطَرِخُونَ فِيهَا رَبَّنَآ أَخْرِجْنَا نَعْمَلْ صَـٰلِحًا غَيْرَ ٱلَّذِى كُنَّا نَعْمَلُ ۚ أَوَلَمْ نُعَمِّرْكُم مَّا يَتَذَكَّرُ فِيهِ مَن تَذَكَّرَ وَجَآءَكُمُ ٱلنَّذِيرُ ۖ فَذُوقُوا۟ فَمَا لِلظَّـٰلِمِينَ مِن نَّصِيرٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will cry out loud in Hell, ‘Lord, let us out, and we will do righteous deeds, not what we did before!’- ‘ Did We not give you a life long enough to take warning if you were going to? The warner came to you, now taste the punishment.’ The evildoers will have nobody to help them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"And they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَصْطَرِخُونَ","en_gloss":"will cry","transliteration":"yaṣṭarikhūna","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبَّنَآ","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَخْرِجْنَا","en_gloss":"Bring us out","transliteration":"akhrij'nā","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَعْمَلْ","en_gloss":"we will do","transliteration":"naʿmal","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"صَـٰلِحًا","en_gloss":"righteous (deeds)","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"غَيْرَ","en_gloss":"other than","transliteration":"ghayra","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(that) which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كُنَّا","en_gloss":"we used","transliteration":"kunnā","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نَعْمَلُ ۚ","en_gloss":"(to) do","transliteration":"naʿmalu","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Did not","transliteration":"awalam","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":13,"ar":"نُعَمِّرْكُم","en_gloss":"We give you life long enough","transliteration":"nuʿammir'kum","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَتَذَكَّرُ","en_gloss":"(would) receive admonition","transliteration":"yatadhakkaru","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":18,"ar":"تَذَكَّرَ","en_gloss":"receives admonition","transliteration":"tadhakkara","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَجَآءَكُمُ","en_gloss":"And came to you","transliteration":"wajāakumu","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلنَّذِيرُ ۖ","en_gloss":"the warner","transliteration":"l-nadhīru","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":21,"ar":"فَذُوقُوا۟","en_gloss":"So taste","transliteration":"fadhūqū","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":22,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":23,"ar":"لِلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"(is) for the wrongdoers","transliteration":"lilẓẓālimīna","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":24,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":25,"ar":"نَّصِيرٍ","en_gloss":"helper","transliteration":"naṣīrin","verse_key":"35:37"},{"pos":26,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:37"}]},{"verse_key":"35:38","surah":35,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَـٰلِمُ غَيْبِ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ عَلِيمٌۢ بِذَاتِ ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God knows all that is hidden in the heavens and earth; He knows the thoughts contained in the heart;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"35:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"35:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَـٰلِمُ","en_gloss":"(is the) Knower","transliteration":"ʿālimu","verse_key":"35:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"غَيْبِ","en_gloss":"(of the) unseen","transliteration":"ghaybi","verse_key":"35:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"35:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"35:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"35:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is the) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"35:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِذَاتِ","en_gloss":"of what (is) in the breasts","transliteration":"bidhāti","verse_key":"35:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_gloss":"of what (is) in the breasts","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","verse_key":"35:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٣٨","en_gloss":"(38)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:38"}]}]}